{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology\/web' data-target='computer\/technology\/web' data-title='Web'>\r\n\t\t\tWeb\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/seo' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/seo' data-title='SEO'>\r\n\t\t\tSEO\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"SEO titles: · as separator, site name at the end with -, unique titles, https shown, www redundant.","label":"Guidelines","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Title is important<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Separator<\/h4>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>|<\/code> too prominent<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-<\/code> mixes up with regular text, unnecessary prominence<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>\u00b7<\/code> best<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShould have the website title at the end. Separator: <code class='inline'>-<\/code> since Google uses it by default for long titles.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tURLs should have unique titles.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t?Decreasing order \u2014 keywords.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPreferably should not be longer than a few words.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTitle shows first in the search results.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Protocol<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps is shown explicitly. http is not displayed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIndents.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>WWW<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRedundant.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/web\/seo\/guidelines\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/web\/seo\/guidelines\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology\/web\/seo' data-target='computer\/technology\/web\/seo' data-title='SEO'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SEO<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}